WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.500
[Waves roll in under the dawn sky]

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.400
[Gulls cry over the harbour]

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.800
[The harbour bell rings]

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.000
[It rings a second time]

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.000
[The waves calm as the sun sets]

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.800
[Silence]
